*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.bin binary
*.exe binary
*.zip binary
*.blend binary
